  "articleBody": "The cost of a whole-house renovation depends less on square footage alone than on the scope hidden behind the finishes: layout changes, structural work, electrical and plumbing upgrades, windows, energy requirements, permits, site access, and the condition of the existing home. A useful estimate should identify assumptions, allowances, exclusions, and choices that could change the final cost.",
